# Flight Booking Data Analysis (Python)

## 📌 Project Overview
This project focuses on analyzing flight booking data using Python. The dataset was cleaned, explored, and visualized to identify booking patterns, trends, and factors affecting flight bookings.

## 🛠 Tools Used
- Python
- Pandas
- NumPy
- Matplotlib
- Seaborn
- Jupyter Notebook / Google Colab

## 📊 Features
- Data Cleaning and Preprocessing
- Missing Values and Duplicate Check
- Exploratory Data Analysis (EDA)
- Flight Booking Trend Analysis
- Data Visualization
- Identification of Booking Patterns
- Analysis of Factors Affecting Flight Bookings

## 📈 Outcome
The project provides meaningful insights into flight booking patterns and trends through data analysis and visualization, helping better understand customer booking behavior.
